[2] LEMMA A baseline:  circuit-free ⇒ good-measure ≈ (1-2δ)^k → e^{-2}
    k | 3term | #rel(|m|≤1) | G-δ (margin) | good-meas | (1-2δ)^k | e^-2
    3 |   0   |     0      |   +0.1500   |  0.1429  |  0.1250 | 0.1353
    4 |   0   |     0      |   +0.3000   |  0.1172  |  0.1296 | 0.1353
    5 |   0   |     0      |   +0.2333   |  0.1207  |  0.1317 | 0.1353
